anybody:
n. Any one out of an indefinite number of persons; anyone;
   any person.
n. A person of consideration or standing.

scragged:
a. Rough with irregular points, or a broken surface;
   scraggy; as, a scragged backbone.
a. Lean and rough; scraggy.

strobilation:
n. The act or phenomenon of spontaneously dividing
   transversely, as do certain species of annelids and helminths;
   transverse fission. See Illust. under Syllidian.
